@CatalogApi_HostAddress = https://localhost:7123

### Get All Catalog Items (Paged)
GET {{CatalogApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/catalog/items?pageIndex=0&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json

### Get Single Catalog Item by ID (Uses Redis Caching)
GET {{CatalogApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/catalog/items/1
Accept: application/json

### Get All Brands
GET {{CatalogApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/catalog/brands
Accept: application/json

### Get All Categories / Types
GET {{CatalogApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/catalog/types
Accept: application/json

### Search Items by Name Keyword
GET {{CatalogApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/catalog/items/by-name/Bot
Accept: application/json

### Create New Catalog Item
POST {{CatalogApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/catalog/items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Dotnet Mug",
  "description": "Ceramic Dotnet mug",
  "price": 15.99,
  "pictureFileName": "mug.png",
  "catalogBrandId": 2,
  "catalogTypeId": 2,
  "availableStock": 50,
  "restockThreshold": 10,
  "maxStockThreshold": 100,
  "onReorder": false
}

### Update Catalog Item
PUT {{CatalogApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/catalog/items/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": ".NET Bot Black Hoodie (Updated)",
  "description": ".NET Black Hoodie Premium",
  "price": 54.99,
  "catalogBrandId": 2,
  "catalogTypeId": 1,
  "availableStock": 120
}

### Delete Catalog Item
DELETE {{CatalogApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/catalog/items/3
